    "title": "Vernon Parish mother and daughter's murders remain under investigation after two years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KPLC Digital Team ,\n10 hours ago HORNBECK, La. (KPLC) - Two years after a mother and daughter were killed in a small Vernon Parish community, investigators continue to search for answers. Ruth Holt, 86, and Fredda Pierce, 64, were found dead in their Hornbeck home on Oct. 8, 2024, after family members called deputies for a welfare check. Sheriff Sam Craft said he believed the double murder was a targeted crime. Read full article\n2",
